WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.023
Unit twenty-two. Screen Time!

2
00:00:04.006 --> 00:00:07.740
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:11.303
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.353 --> 00:00:14.879
Today we learn about Screen Time. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.828 --> 00:00:19.395
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

6
00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:25.927
Phone. Say it with me. Phone!

7
00:00:29.426 --> 00:00:32.726
TV. Say it with me. TV!

8
00:00:36.223 --> 00:00:39.490
Game. Say it with me. Game!

9
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:46.324
Time. Say it with me. Time!

10
00:00:49.827 --> 00:00:52.927
Break. Say it with me. Break!

11
00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:59.723
Play. Say it with me. Play!

12
00:01:03.223 --> 00:01:06.556
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

13
00:01:10.059 --> 00:01:19.459
A phone, TV, or game screen can be fun, but too much screen time is not healthy. I take a break to play outside. I turn off screens before sleep.

14
00:01:19.509 --> 00:01:20.813
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.062 --> 00:01:27.334
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.384 --> 00:01:28.534
TV!

17
00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:34.290
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.490
Play!

19
00:01:36.286 --> 00:01:41.213
Did you know? Bright screens at night can make it harder to fall asleep!

20
00:01:41.263 --> 00:01:43.050
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:51.421
Think and answer. What can you do instead of using a screen?

22
00:01:51.471 --> 00:01:52.621
Great answer!

23
00:01:53.774 --> 00:01:58.824
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:58.874 --> 00:02:01.531
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

